If the monitor has an AUTO switch then try that one. Generally, it
will try for its optimum setting and display what it is trying to
achieve.
Most (if not all) LCD's run at 60 Hz so set decw$server_refresh_rate
to 60.
CRT's are usually run at 72 Hz, 75 Hz or even higher frequencies.
Check the value of decw$server_refresh_rate.
Hans


