   Crucial Part Number: CT142821 128MB  168-pin DIMM
   SDRAM, 66MHz  CL=2  Unbuffered  ECC  10ns  3.3V  16Meg x 72

        Size
    Kit  Module   Part Nr.      Model Nr. (2-module kit)
    32MB   16MB   54-25084-BA   SN-MSP01-HB
    64MB   32MB   54-25084-DA   SN-MSP01-HC
