   256MB  128MB   54-25092-DA   SN-MSP01-HE
   512MB  256MB   54-25158-DA   SN-MSP01-HF

   Memory installed as of 27-FEB-2004:

   Bank 0: 2* 256MB   DEC 54-25158-DA   SN-MSP01-HF
