The memory in the DS 5305 and the XP1000 are not the same. The XP1000
uses registered DRAM, the 5305 doesn't.
Pop the memory boards and look for manufacturer codes. If you're lucky
there's Micron memory in them.
Micron lists very detailed spec sheets on their site (see
home.zonnet.nl/hvlems for details on memory)
Hans


